OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FFirefighters were able to reduce the
OL,8,Fnumber of appliances tackling a blaze
OL,9,Fwhich has caused "total devastation"
OL,10,Fto heathland in Suffolk after the
OL,11,FNational Trust announced a public
OL,12,Fappeal to restore the reserve.
OL,14,FFourteen appliances had been in
OL,15,Fattendance at Dunwich Heath, near
OL,16,FLeiston, although that was reduced to
OL,17,Feight for overnight operations after
OL,18,F"positive firefighting action... and
OL,19,Fthe creation of further firebreaks" on
OL,20,FFriday.
OL,26,@qD@ROUqD@dO]zD@AOU{D@cO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
