CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785656875
OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FIn an update on Saturday morning,
OL,8,FSuffolk Fire and Rescue said: "With
OL,9,Fthe weekend here, we continue to ask
OL,10,Fmembers of the public to avoid the
OL,11,Farea and keep roads clear for
OL,12,Femergency vehicles. Local roads and
OL,13,Ffootpaths remain closed."
OL,15,FFire crews are expected to remain on
OL,16,Fscene for the next two or three days,
OL,17,Fthe service said on Saturday.
OL,26,@pD@_OUuD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
