OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FOn Friday, the National Trust launched
OL,13,Fan emergency fundraising drive after
OL,14,Fthe wildfire left the landscape
OL,15,F"unrecognisable".
OL,17,FNational Trust director-general Hilary
OL,18,FMcGrady has described the
OL,19,F"heartbreaking" loss of an important
OL,20,Fhabitat which was home to rare species.
OL,26,@wD@AOUwD@PO]{D@AOU{D@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
