PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785656875
OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FThe charity said the heath was an
OL,8,Fimportant area for wildlife such as
OL,9,Fnightjars, skylarks and the rare
OL,10,FDartford warbler, as well as adders,
OL,11,Flizards and slow worms, and
OL,12,Fbutterflies including the rare silver-
OL,13,Fstudded blue.
OL,15,FThe lowland heath habitat is one of
OL,16,Fthe UK's rarest and an estimated 92%
OL,17,Fof it has been lost in England over
OL,18,Fthe last 120 years, it added.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
