PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785656875
OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FIn a statement on Friday, Ms McGrady
OL,8,Fsaid: "We are looking at total
OL,9,Fdevastation of a beloved and important
OL,10,Flandscape.
OL,12,F"We've lost precious habitats,
OL,13,Fwildlife, trees, and a place where
OL,14,Fpeople have made memories over
OL,15,Fgenerations. It's heartbreaking.
OL,17,F"But together we can and will restore
OL,18,FDunwich and, crucially, make it more
OL,19,Fresilient and better adapted for the
OL,20,Fclimate we're facing now, and the
OL,21,Fclimate we'll be facing in future.
OL,26,@pD@GOUtD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785656875
OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,F"We're working hard to tackle climate
OL,8,Fchange and prepare for more of it, but
OL,9,Fthere's more hard work to be done.
OL,11,F"We can't do it alone. We're a charity
OL,12,Fthat relies on public support in so
OL,13,Fmany ways. If you can donate, however
OL,14,Fmuch, please don't hesitate.
OL,16,F"Your money will go directly to the
OL,17,Frestoration of Dunwich, to regrow
OL,18,Fhabitats and homes for wildlife, build
OL,19,Fmore resilience into the landscape,
OL,20,Fand return this iconic place to the
OL,21,Fnation."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU}D@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
