OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FFootage of the scene shows the once
OL,8,Fgrassy, coastal area known for its
OL,9,Fcarpet of purple heather reduced to a
OL,10,Fcharred, barren landscape, which is
OL,11,Fstill smouldering.
OL,13,FCrews continued to battle the blaze on
OL,14,FFriday, and evacuated residents and
OL,15,Fholidaymakers were given a short
OL,16,Fwindow of opportunity to collect
OL,17,Fessential belongings under police
OL,18,Fescort.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
