OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FFirefighters across the country have
OL,8,Fbeen tackling similar but smaller
OL,9,Ffires.
OL,11,FMore than 20 fire services have been
OL,12,Fresponding to fires amid hot and dry
OL,13,Fconditions which have left half of
OL,14,FEngland and all of Wales in drought.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
