OL,3,CCrews reduce appliances at Suffolk
OL,4,Cwildfire as National Trust launch
OL,5,Cfundraiser
OL,7,FOn Tuesday, the National Fire Chiefs
OL,8,FCouncil said more than 200 wildfires
OL,9,Fhad been reported in England and Wales
OL,10,Fin less than two weeks, and wildfire
OL,11,Frisk remained "elevated".
